WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.467 --> 00:00:11.149
I wanted to design a special invitation card.

2
00:00:11.150 --> 00:00:15.644
So I used the computer.

3
00:00:15.645 --> 00:00:20.149
Hana: I am going to make a nice invitation card.

4
00:00:20.150 --> 00:00:22.444
Bada: An invitation card?

5
00:00:22.445 --> 00:00:23.914
Can I watch?

6
00:00:23.915 --> 00:00:26.786
Hana: Sure, but just be quiet.

7
00:00:26.787 --> 00:00:30.167
Bada: Okay.

8
00:00:30.168 --> 00:00:33.093
Hana: Done! Let's print it out!

9
00:00:33.094 --> 00:00:36.097
Hmm. Looks good to me.

10
00:00:36.098 --> 00:00:39.243
Hana: Let me show it to Mom.

11
00:00:39.244 --> 00:00:43.037
Bada: Can I see it too?

12
00:00:43.038 --> 00:00:47.342
Hana: Mom, Mom. Here is my invitation.

13
00:00:47.343 --> 00:00:50.113
Mom: What does it say?

14
00:00:50.114 --> 00:00:53.145
Hana: This is what I wrote.

15
00:00:53.146 --> 00:00:56.380
What: Hana's Birthday Party

16
00:00:56.381 --> 00:01:00.536
When: Saturday, July 13 at 2 p.m.

17
00:01:00.537 --> 00:01:08.218
Where: At my house (phone: 348-8079)

18
00:01:08.219 --> 00:01:13.596
Game: A treasure hunt, finders keepers!

19
00:01:13.597 --> 00:01:14.978
Hana: How is that?

20
00:01:14.979 --> 00:01:19.022
Mom: Sounds like fun.

21
00:01:19.023 --> 00:01:21.305
Bada: What's a treasure hunt?

22
00:01:21.306 --> 00:01:23.797
Mom: You look for hidden things.

23
00:01:23.798 --> 00:01:25.870
Bada: What kind of things?

24
00:01:25.871 --> 00:01:29.337
Hana: Wait and see.

25
00:01:29.338 --> 00:01:32.559
How do you plan your birthday party?

26
00:01:32.560 --> 00:01:40.580
I like to have a special event every time.
